      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِسَآءٌ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَسُوٌّ</span></b>  <i>A medicine,</i> or <i>remedy;</i> (S, M,
K;) the latter, (S,) or each, (TA,) particularly
<i>a vulnerary:</i> (S, TA:) pl. [of each, as is indicated
in the TA,] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">آسِيَةٌ</span>. (M, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  The former is also
a pl. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">آسٍ</span>. (S, M, K.)

